due to energy conservation technologies and public initiatives to reduce electricity consumption or to recessionary economic conditions;
and</span></td>
</tr></table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 48pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24pt">&#160;</p><div>

