permissible non-audit services to be performed by Zeo&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm;</span></td>
</tr></table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

