<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.35in; text-align: left"><span style="font-size: 10pt">(iv)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">a lump sum cash payment, payable
on the date of termination, equal to the sum of the following: (x) one year&#8217;s base salary at the annualized rate then in effect
